==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
*1 [[Berserkory]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It may sound scary, but all you need are [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and a bunch of tankers that can survive attacks from Kory and Berserkory: [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed M. Titan Cat]], with [[Cat Combo]]s to make them even more effective at their job. These five units should be more than enough to handle the koalas, after which you can easily stall the three Nyandam variants. Alternatively, you can use [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block the Kories' waves along with disposable attackers such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. It is also possible to rush down the base before Galactic Overseer Nyandam spawns.

